Package: bonsaisitter
Type: Package
Title: Tree-Sitter Bindings for R
Version: 0.1.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"),
    person("Max", "Brunsfeld", role = "cph",
           comment = "tree-sitter C library"),
    person("Davis", "Vaughan", role = "cph",
           comment = "treesitter package, whose API this mirrors"))
Description: A runtime for the tree-sitter parsing library that mirrors the
    'treesitter' package API, so it can serve as a drop-in replacement.
    Parses source code into concrete syntax trees for fast, incremental
    analysis. Grammars come from separate packages (such as 'treesitter.r'),
    so the runtime itself carries zero hard dependencies.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/cornball-ai/bonsaisitter
BugReports: https://github.com/cornball-ai/bonsaisitter/issues
NeedsCompilation: yes
Suggests: tinytest, treesitter, treesitter.r
